{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Welcome to the Ladies' Academy!&quot; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yukiko has arrived at the prestigious Aoi Academy for young ladies. A new beginning and new friendships. Will this be the life she has always dreamed of, or is there something deeper? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this new adventure she meets Hoshiko, an enigmatic girl with whom she shares intimate and sincere moments. In that space between love and doubt, something deep begins to awaken along with a strange feeling of being trapped in an endless dream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roses Of Love is a short but intense visual novel of the GL genre, an emotional journey that combines romance, sensitivity and subtle psychological tension.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Credits</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Temporary backgrounds: Minikle, Claire (NoranekoGames), and Selavi Games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Music: Souichi Sakagami (Trial &amp; Error) and Kevin MacLeod</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Temporary sprites: Claire (NoranekoGames)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Spanish proofreading: Suki</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > English Translation: Suki</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Spanish &amp; English Proofreading: Suki</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > English Proofreading: MaryZ </p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"20847fc31689d3e5c2ef7b941f2a0ae545b45b56.jpg","localized_name":"Welcome to the academy! ","name":"Welcome to the academy! ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1299800/20847fc31689d3e5c2ef7b941f2a0ae545b45b56.jpg"},{"icon":"1e7f297e35d58f0d886017048d07fe8efd0f8bb8.jpg","localized_name":"My dear princess of the stars","name":"My dear princess of the stars","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1299800/1e7f297e35d58f0d886017048d07fe8