ichi Sakagami (Trial &amp; Error) and Kevin MacLeod</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Temporary sprites: Claire (NoranekoGames)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Spanish proofreading: Suki</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > English Translation: Suki</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Spanish &amp; English Proofreading: Suki</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > English Proofreading: MaryZ </p></li></ul>","developers":["KagariSoft","UnSetSoft"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1299800/03f6ea05956dab60676bafcad314bbc85d1af825/header.jpg?t=1776972690","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 KagariSoft / UnSetSoft. Some rights reserved<br />\r\nThe content of this game is fiction, any resemblance to reality is coincidental.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 22.04+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 GHz or higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> The game can run in every linux distro based on debian</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10.15<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 GHz or higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Bugs were detected with macOS 13, so the execution may fail.</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1299800/623257/115533672dfa7b226d51269e8f33955622c63ac3/1751217749/dash_av1.mpd?t=1728351315","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1299800/623